53#issuecomment-1206642218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1553","id":1206642218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85H6-Yq","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-05T16:36:09Z","updated_at":"2022-08-05T16:36:09Z","body":"I'm +1 to add. Easily meets open source requirements, plus use in Webkit + Fedora (I've also independently encountered this one in the past when scanning, though that's anecdotal and I can't recall which project I saw it in).\r\n\r\nDoesn't appear to match anything currently on the license list. A google search for `\"freely granted\" site:spdx.org` doesn't find any use of \"freely granted\" in current licenses and a search for that term in this GitHub repo doesn't appear to find it either.\r\n\r\nLink to specific instance of use in WebKit is [here](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/216222305a471152da8402070e964e1f2c023938/Source/JavaScriptCore/runtime/MathCommon.cpp#L53-L59).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1206642218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1206712073","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1553#issuecomment-1206712073","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1553","id":1206712073,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85H7PcJ","user":{"login":"seabass-labrax","id":79224200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MjI0MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79224200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax","html_url":"https://github.com/seabass-labrax","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seabass-labrax/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-05T18:03:25Z","updated_at":"2022-08-05T18:03:25Z","body":"# New submission review\r\n\r\n## Has the license been approved by the OSI?\r\n*All OSI-approved license will be included on the SPDX License List, regardless of other factors*\r\n\r\nNo, it doesn't seem that the OSI has reviewed this license.\r\n\r\n## Definitive factors\r\n*These must all be satisfied to allow inclusion in the license list*\r\n\r\n### Is the submitted license unique, that is, it does not match another license already on the License List as per the matching guidelines?\r\n\r\nYes, it is not already on the SPDX License List.\r\n\r\n### If a software license, does it apply to source code and not only to executables?\r\n\r\nYes, it can apply to source code as well as executables.\r\n\r\n### Does the license have identifiable and stable text, and is not in the midst of drafting?\r\n\r\nYes, it is a historical license and not expected to change.\r\n\r\n### Has the license steward, if any, committed to versioning new versions in the future and to not modify it after addition to the list?\r\n\r\nMaybe: the license steward (Sun Microsystems) is no longer active, and their successor (Oracle) seems unlikely to modify it.\r\n\r\n## Other factors for inclusion\r\n*Roughly in order of descending importance*\r\n\r\n### 1. Does the license substantially comply with one of the free/open content definitions?\r\n*Approval by the organisation that publishes the definition is not required*\r\n\r\nYes, the license appears to fulfil the requirements of all the free/open content definitions used by SPDX.\r\n\r\n### 2. Is the license structured to be generally usable by anyone, and not specific to one organisation or project?\r\n\r\nYes, with replaceable text for the `Developed at SunPro, a Sun Microsystems, Inc. business.` or other copyright line.\r\n\r\n### 3. Does the license have substantial use such that it is likely to be encountered (ie. use in many projects, or in one significant project)?\r\n*For recently written licenses, definitive plans for it to be used in at least one or a few significant projects may satisfy this*\r\n\r\nYes, it is used in multiple software libraries which are available in major free software distributions. \r\n\r\n### 4. Is the license primarily intended to facilitate the free distribution of content with limited restrictions?\r\n\r\nYes; see factor 1.\r\n\r\n### 5. Does the license steward support this submission, or is at least aware of and not in opposition of it?\r\n\r\nThere is no indication that the license steward is aware of this submission.\r\n\r\n## Summary of factors / outcome\r\n*Comments on the totality of these \"other factors\" in light of the SPDX License List's overall goals and objectives*\r\n\r\nGiven the status the historical usage of this license and its ongoing presence in prominent open source projects, I would strongly support the addition of this license in the SPDX License List.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1206712073/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1207141046","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1553#issuecomment-1207141046","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1553","id":1207141046,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85H84K2","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-08-